{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"拓扑学","text":"拓扑学"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"T1空间"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"T1 空间"},2]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>$T_1$ 空间是满足如下等价条件的拓扑空间 $X$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对任意 $x,y\\in X$, 若 $x\\neq y$, 则存在 $x$ 的开邻域 $U$ 不包含 $y$.</li>\n<li>$X$ 的每个点作为子集都是闭的.</li>\n</ul>\n"}}